{"unit_id":"Harzva__dsh-agent-project-sync#card-zh","repo":"Harzva/dsh-agent-project-sync","commit":"5ff9b30f5a3cc4d798af7288920c539ac2d84515","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-project-sync 是一款面向 DSH Web profile 的项目目录桥接插件，可将 Codex 与 Claude Code 使用过的项目发现并登记为原生 Workspace。它在 DSH 中注册扫描、清单查看、同步和手动添加工具，并提供本地 CLI 管理共享项目清单。扫描时从会话 JSONL 的有限开头提取 cwd，按真实路径去重；同步可预览或在明确确认后创建缺少的 Workspace。适合在不同本地编程智能体之间共享项目目录并从 DSH 接手的开发者。需要本机智能体数据目录和 DSH home，不需要 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-24","lib/tools.js:130-163","lib/tools.js:195-263","lib/discovery.js:63-107"]}
{"unit_id":"Harzva__dsh-agent-project-sync#card-en","repo":"Harzva/dsh-agent-project-sync","commit":"5ff9b30f5a3cc4d798af7288920c539ac2d84515","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-agent-project-sync finds Codex and Claude Code project directories and registers them as DSH Workspaces. Tools scan, list, and sync projects using cwd from bounded JSONL headers. Sync previews by default and requires confirmation to create Workspaces. It uses local data and needs no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-24","lib/tools.js:130-163","lib/tools.js:195-263","lib/discovery.js:63-107"]}
